 crates/victory-shader/src/emit/lower.rs       | 60 ++++++++++++++----
 .../victory-shader/src/emit/wave64_tests.rs   | 62 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 111 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

